Subject: problem with hline when used with stat_summary
Message-ID: <7VsU1e65EZo.BZIqQArpWCEJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/ggplot2/c/7VsU1e65EZo/m/BZIqQArpWCEJ>
